From 71b4b83deff3558c967eba539ac46b9e33ee72f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1aeo <github@1aeo.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:14:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] metrics: Answer MetricsPort requests from a dedicated
 thread

Hand CONN_TYPE_METRICS_LISTENER to metrics_configure_listener() in connection_listener_new(), refreshing the HTTP response snapshot once per second on the main thread and starting the worker thread from that main-loop event (after privilege drop and seccomp sandbox initialization).

Closes #41458.
